OL,3,CWildfires in Wales: Why has there been
OL,4,Can epidemic this summer?
OL,6,FThroughout the summer, Wales has
OL,7,Fsuffered multiple wildfires up and
OL,8,Fdown the country.
OL,10,FFrom a major blaze on the Rhinogydd
OL,11,Fmountains in the north to nearly 200-
OL,12,Facres of land being burnt in Blaenavon
OL,13,Fin the south, concerns are being
OL,14,Fraised about our ability to fight such
OL,15,Ffires and protect our landscape.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/9
