OL,3,CWildfires in Wales: Why has there been
OL,4,Can epidemic this summer?
OL,6,FITV News spoke to Professor Stefan
OL,7,FDoerr, Director of Centre for Wildfire
OL,8,FResearch at Swansea University, to
OL,9,Fexplore why the country has faced so
OL,10,Fmany wildfire outbreaks, and what we
OL,11,Fcan expect from future summers.
OL,13,FWhy has Wales had so many wildfires?
OL,15,FWales has faced an exceptionally dry
OL,16,Fsummer. The whole country has been
OL,17,Fdeclared to be in drought status, with
OL,18,Fthis year seeing the driest July since
OL,19,Frecords began nearly 200 years ago.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
