OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786114088
OL,3,CWildfires in Wales: Why has there been
OL,4,Can epidemic this summer?
OL,6,FProfessor Doerr explained that Wales
OL,7,Fhas faced multiple wildfires largely
OL,8,Fdue to the long drought period.
OL,10,FHe said: "This year has been
OL,11,Fexceptionally dry, so any ignition
OL,12,Fsource will very likely turn into a
OL,13,Fwildfire. Fundamentally, it is down to
OL,14,Fthe extremely long drought that Wales
OL,15,Fhas had.
OL,17,F"Without a doubt, Wales will see more
OL,18,Fsummer wildfires.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
