CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786114088
OL,3,CWildfires in Wales: Why has there been
OL,4,Can epidemic this summer?
OL,6,F"Dry seasons and high temperatures are
OL,7,Fpredicted to become more frequent and
OL,8,Fbe more extreme, which will dry out
OL,9,FWales' vegetation.
OL,11,F"If fires are in the summer, they are
OL,12,Fmuch more destructive. This is because
OL,13,Fthey generate more energy that travels
OL,14,Finto the ground that harms the soil.
OL,15,FWhilst vegetation does get damaged, it
OL,16,Fwill come back. It could just take
OL,17,Fdecades to recover."
OL,19,FWhy do wildfires spread so easily?
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
