OL,3,CWildfires in Wales: Why has there been
OL,4,Can epidemic this summer?
OL,6,FProfessor Doerr described three main
OL,7,Ffactors that cause wildfires to
OL,8,Fspread. These are windy conditions,
OL,9,FWales' rich grasslands and the
OL,10,Fcountry's soil quality.
OL,12,FHe said: "Normally when we have high
OL,13,Fpressure systems, the conditions are
OL,14,Fvery calm and we do not often have
OL,15,Fwindy conditions.
OL,17,F"This year, we had quite a few fires
OL,18,Fthat were fanned by strong easterly
OL,19,Fwinds. As soon as you have a wind,
OL,20,Ffires can spread very rapidly.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
