CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786114088
OL,3,CWildfires in Wales: Why has there been
OL,4,Can epidemic this summer?
OL,6,F"Also, Wales has such a large extent
OL,7,Fof landscape covered in grass. Grass
OL,8,Fis the one fuel, or flammable
OL,9,Fvegetation, that allows the fastest
OL,10,Fspread of wildfires."
OL,12,F"Wales has a lot of organic rich soils
OL,13,Fthat doesn't burn quickly, but it can
OL,14,Fburn for a very long time. You can put
OL,15,Fthe blaze out, but a day later it can
OL,16,Fcome back. This re-ignition makes
OL,17,Ffirefighting in the summer, in Wales,
OL,18,Fextremely challenging."
OL,20,FHow do wildfires get put out?
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G6/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
