OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786114088
OL,3,CWildfires in Wales: Why has there been
OL,4,Can epidemic this summer?
OL,6,FWhilst water can often be seen as the
OL,7,Fobvious way of cooling wildfires,
OL,8,FProfessor Doerr explained how this can
OL,9,Fbe a common misconception:
OL,11,FHe said: "In theory, yes water is the
OL,12,Fway. But if you're up on a hill with a
OL,13,Flarge-scale fire, there is no chance
OL,14,Fof getting water on all of it.
OL,16,F"Firefighting is actually very often
OL,17,Fhard physical work in generating a
OL,18,Fbarrier where the fire can't travel
OL,19,Fthrough.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G7/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
