PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786114088
OL,3,CWildfires in Wales: Why has there been
OL,4,Can epidemic this summer?
OL,6,F"You let the fire burn into a barrier
OL,7,F- this could be removing the
OL,8,Fvegetation along a track, or you might
OL,9,Fhave a road and wet the vegetation
OL,10,Falong the road and when the fire
OL,11,Farrives the vegetation will
OL,12,Fessentially burn itself out.
OL,14,F"This method is called containment,
OL,15,Fand this is essentially the most
OL,16,Faffective way of dealing with most
OL,17,Flarge fires."
OL,19,FCalls have been growing for the Welsh
OL,20,FGovernment to reexamine how fires on
OL,21,Fthis scale can be tackled.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G8/9
