OL,3,CWildfires in Wales: Why has there been
OL,4,Can epidemic this summer?
OL,6,FThis week, First Minister Rhun ap
OL,7,FIorwerth promised to hold a summit "to
OL,8,Fensure fire and rescue services have
OL,9,Fthe support and resources they need to
OL,10,Frespond effectively in the future."
OL,12,FIn a statement, the Welsh Government
OL,13,Fsaid: "The First Minister has informed
OL,14,Fthe Fire Brigades Union that he plans
OL,15,Fto convene a multi-agency summit to
OL,16,Fensure the fire and rescue service is
OL,17,Fproperly supported to respond to
OL,18,Ffuture wildfires."
